;UFNTER:  ENTER OPCODE (D/E/F/P/S/Q... ):$
*T ==> "gsmoo1" is the smoother program for 1d Ufile data.
;UFNTER:  ENTER OPCODE (D/E/F/P/S/Q... ):$
F Z MAX Q
;UFNTER:  ENTER OPCODE (D/E/F/P/S/Q... ):$
PSQ
;GSMOO1:  ENTER 5 DIGIT SHOT #, "Q" TO QUIT, "D" TO CHANGE NAMES$
89586
;GSMOO1: ENTER OPTION CODE:$
G N
;GSMOO1: ENTER OPTION CODE:$
*T units transformation -- y axis to KeV
U
;UCHUNS:  ENTER NEW UNITS (10 CHAR LABEL) OR "0" NOT TO CHANGE:$
0
;UCHUNS:  ENTER NEW UNITS (10 CHAR LABEL) OR "0" NOT TO CHANGE:$
"KeV"
;UCHUNS:  ENTER CONVERSION FACTOR A: (NEW UNITS PER OLD UNIT)$
0.001
;UCHUNS:  ENTER OFFSET B (QUANTITY TO ADD OR FACTOR INTO DATA):$
0
;GSMOO1: ENTER OPTION CODE:$
G N
;GSMOO1: ENTER OPTION CODE:$
*T adjustment to data -- sharpen up pellet event at 2.0125 seconds
1
;GPRESET: TYPE "A" FOR AXES, "S" FOR SCALING DEFAULTS, OR "Q":$
S
; GSCDEF >> ENTER SCALING OPTION # FOR * X-AXIS *:$
3
;GSCDEF>> ENTER NEW XMIN:$
2.01
;GSCDEF>> ENTER NEW XMAX:$
2.02
; GSCDEF >> ENTER SCALING OPTION # FOR * Y-AXIS *:$
1
;GPRESET: TYPE "A" FOR AXES, "S" FOR SCALING DEFAULTS, OR "Q":$
Q
;GSMOO1: ENTER OPTION CODE:$
B
; DCUTP3: ENTER OPTION #:$
A
; DCUTP3: ENTER OPTION #:$
B
; DCUTP3: ENTER OPTION #:$
1
;DCUTP3:  ENTER LOCATION OF FIRST CUT (X-UNITS):$
2.0125 2.0155
;GRAOPT:  ENTER ONE LETTER OPCODE (.C/A/S/X/Z/G/P/Q):$
Q
; DCUTP3: ENTER OPTION #:$
2
; DCUTP3: ENTER OPTION #:$
3
;GSMOO1: ENTER OPTION CODE:$
1
;GPRESET: TYPE "A" FOR AXES, "S" FOR SCALING DEFAULTS, OR "Q":$
S
; GSCDEF >> ENTER SCALING OPTION # FOR * X-AXIS *:$
1
; GSCDEF >> ENTER SCALING OPTION # FOR * Y-AXIS *:$
1
;GPRESET: TYPE "A" FOR AXES, "S" FOR SCALING DEFAULTS, OR "Q":$
Q
;GSMOO1: ENTER OPTION CODE:$
*T smooth the data (this takes some cpu time)
*T first smooth without preservation of pellet events
S
; SUB:USMOO1 >> ENTER OPTION #:$
3
; SUB:PCIDEF >> ENTER OPTION #:$
1
; SUB:PCIDEF > ENTER NEW X VALUE:$
1
; SUB:PCIDEF > ENTER NEW Y VALUE:$
.075
; SUB:PCIDEF >> ENTER OPTION #:$
5
; SUB:USMOO1 >> ENTER OPTION #:$
10
; USMOO1:  ENTER "Y" TO PLOT DELTA(FINAL):$
N
; SUB:USMOO1 >> ENTER OPTION #:$
2
;GRAOPT:  ENTER ONE LETTER OPCODE (.C/A/S/X/Z/G/P/Q):$
Q
; SUB:USMOO1 >> ENTER OPTION #:$
*T now modify smooth to arrange for preservation of pellet events
I
;INORD:  ENTER NEW ITEM OR OPTION FOR LIST "INTERIOR SMOOTHING ENDPTS":$
2.0125 2.4135
;INORD:  ENTER NEW ITEM OR OPTION FOR LIST "INTERIOR SMOOTHING ENDPTS":$
Q
; SUB:USMOO1 >> ENTER OPTION #:$
10
; USMOO1:  ENTER "Y" TO PLOT DELTA(FINAL):$
N
; SUB:USMOO1 >> ENTER OPTION #:$
2
;GRAOPT:  ENTER ONE LETTER OPCODE (.C/A/S/X/Z/G/P/Q):$
Q
; SUB:USMOO1 >> ENTER OPTION #:$
11
;GSMOO1: ENTER OPTION CODE:$
*T plots to compare smoothed and unsmoothed data
K
;GRAOPT:  ENTER ONE LETTER OPCODE (.C/A/S/X/Z/G/P/Q):$
X 1 3
;GRAOPT:  ENTER ONE LETTER OPCODE (.C/A/S/X/Z/G/P/Q):$
X 4 6
;GRAOPT:  ENTER ONE LETTER OPCODE (.C/A/S/X/Z/G/P/Q):$
Q
;GSMOO1: ENTER OPTION CODE:$
X
